---
// src/components/Hero.astro
---

<section class="flex flex-col items-center text-center pt-10 pb-20 animate-fade-in">
	
	<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle shadow-lg mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
		<span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
		  <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-red-400 opacity-75"></span>
		  <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-red-500"></span>
		</span>
		<span class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300">Junior Pentester @ EY</span>
	</div>
	
	<h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-6">
		Offensive <br/>
		<span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-red-400 to-red-600">
			Security
		</span>
	</h1>
	
	<h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-6">
		<span class="text-zinc-200">Alejandro Juan Hervás Vogt</span> | <span class="text-red-accent">linkario</span>
	</h2>
	
	<p class="text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">
		Enfocado en Web App Pentesting y auditoría de infraestructuras. Entiendo el pentesting como un aprendizaje continuo: dedico cada día a entender el <i>porqué</i> de las cosas, construir mis propias herramientas y mejorar la calidad de mis reportes.	</p>
	<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
		<a href="/tu-cv.pdf" class="px-6 py-3 bg-red-accent text-white font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-red-hover hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(225,29,72,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2">
			Descargar CV
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
		</a>
		
		<a href="https://github.com/tu-usuario" class="px-6 py-3 bg-bg-card text-zinc-300 font-medium rounded-full border border-border-subtle hover:border-red-accent/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg>
			GitHub
		</a>
	</div>
</section>